// ==== Dispatcher_StackableActionUse::process (ORIG 0x0825e11e) ====
// b28d-solo-Dispatchers verdict=DIFF(routed) [N82] ORIG 0x0825e11e orig/ours=145/158 ndiff-blocks=25
//   帧差 sub $4 vs $90 + 槽号漂移（4.1 不按 lifetime 复用栈槽）
